  'Form I-129, Petition for a Nonimmigrant Worker', 'Filed by the petitioner — the U.S. employer or agent — on the worker''s behalf, not by the worker. USCIS states the edition date is 02/27/26 and that pages from a different edition may cause the form to be rejected. USCIS also notes that only certain classifications may currently be filed online.',
